1. M. W. Hirsch, S. Smale and R. L. Devaney, *Differential Equations, Dynamical Systems, and an Introduction to Chaos*,
   3rd ed., Academic Press (2013), chapters 4, 8 and 11.
2. S. H. Strogatz, *Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos*, 2nd ed., Westview Press (2015), chapters 5 and 6 (the rabbits and
   sheep example is from section 6.4).
3. A. J. Lotka, *Elements of Physical Biology*, Williams & Wilkins (1925); V. Volterra, "Variazioni e fluttuazioni del
   numero d'individui in specie animali conviventi", *Memorie della Accademia dei Lincei* 2 (1926) 31–113.
4. C. S. Elton and M. Nicholson, "The ten-year cycle in numbers of the lynx in Canada", *Journal of Animal Ecology* 11
   (1942) 215–244.
